    },
    {
      "text": "City construction update (August 19, 2026): site work around Constitution, Chrysler and Independence Drives covers demolition, utility undergrounding, erosion control, drainage, retaining walls and fencing; initial phase is demolition and rough grading. Owner Sobrato Organization; contractor Sobrato Builders, Inc.",
